      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Lovettes Christmas Special  is a festive 90-minute celebration that blends beloved holiday classics with the iconic girl group and female-fronted hits of the 1950s and ’60s. This dynamic Chicago-based trio delivers a dazzling, harmony-rich tribute to the trailblazing women who defined the golden"
